      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is not their area of expertise, nor their goal. Something of that magnitude requires millions of dollars of research from massive corporations because of the processing power and suite of experts in computing and language required. If you're talking about implementing something such as Google Translate, it's still FAR from usable in casual conversation, and as far as I know, has no straightforward implementation into things that are not web-based, if that. And seeing as even basic web panels have just been removed again, it's far from that. Also, any implementation of Google's software would likely require licenses, which would be an added unnecessary cost for VRChat's dev team.",
